# Arrowing across the desktop. Each icon raises focus, and a moment later its
# tooltip opens with the file description.
#
# Reported on hardware: "sometimes I'll hear the name of the icon and other
# times it will be replaced with the tooltip and not the icon." The provider
# mapped ToolTipOpened onto AlertRaised, alerts are Now priority, and Now drops
# everything pending and cuts off whatever is playing. So the tooltip killed the
# name of the very thing it was describing — and whether you heard the name
# depended on how fast the tooltip appeared, which is why it was intermittent.
#
# A tooltip is now its own reason at Background priority. It waits.

node icon ListItem "Recycle Bin" pos=1 size=12
node tip  ToolTip  "Contains the files you have deleted"
focus icon
tooltip tip

expect
  Recycle Bin, list item, 1 of 12
  Contains the files you have deleted
